# World Intelligence V2 — no API keys required in this project.
#
# This project is a read-only consumer of hub-exported JSON files.
# It does not call any external APIs directly.
#
# To load intelligence data locally:
#   Drop hub-exported files into public/data/imports/:
#     - events.json
#     - energy-indicators.json
#     - macro-indicators.json
#     - manifest.json
#
#   The app falls back to *.example.json files automatically
#   if the real files are not present — no setup needed for dev.
#
# API credentials (ACLED, EIA, NewsAPI, etc.) belong in the hub project.
